        "name": "Childlike Plant",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You're adept at hiding your plantlike features to pass as a human. You become trained in Deception (or another skill if you're already trained in Deception). You don't require a disguise kit when attempting Deception checks to Impersonate a human. In addition, you gain a +4 circumstance bonus to Impersonate checks to pretend that you're a human version of yourself, rather than a leshy. This bonus doesn't apply to other checks to Impersonate humans.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "chrysanthemum leshy heritage or peachchild leshy heritage"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.deception.rank",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "key": "FlatModifier",
              "label": "PF2E.SkillVariant.ImpersonateHumanVersion",
              "predicate": [
                "action:impersonate",
                "impersonate-human-self"
              ],
              "selector": "deception",
              "type": "circumstance",
              "value": 4
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "leshy"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
